  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>Aq_PlantGarlic</defName>
    <label>garlic plant</label>
    <description>A plant with long, flat grasslike leaves forming a stalk, which rises directly from the flower bulb, the part of the plant used as food and medicine. The bulb is made up of many smaller cloves covered with a papery skin. Garlic has very little yield, but can grow in almost any terrain and takes an obscene time to rot, as dried garlic can be used to cook too.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>25</MaxHitPoints>
      <Nutrition>0.05</Nutrition>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
